History

The enforcement core - the token chain, the ledger, the audit trail, the
gateway and the agent graph - was written by @Somay-kousis between 2026-08-28
and 2026-09-01, against Google Cloud services.

The AWS port - Amazon Bedrock, the Strands Agents runtime, the Cedar
authorisation policy and the DynamoDB storage backends - is documented
file-by-file in PORTING.md.

